comments:
I guess this would break users that use live-restore, but we don't support live-restore when upgrading major releases, so I guess from that perspective this would be ok.

Note that _before_ https://github.com/docker/containerd-packaging/pull/146, we didn't bundle `containerd-shim-runc-v2`, so containerd.io packages `< v1.2.13-2` would not have this shim. I don't expect users to _downgrade_ containerd to an older version, but we should probably raise the minimum version in our packages if we make this change.


@cpuguy83 @tonistiigi @tiborvass PTAL

